# packages/web — Vite build-time config. Copy to .env and edit as needed.
# Every var MUST be prefixed VITE_ to reach the client bundle.
# NOTE: these values are compiled INTO the public bundle — never put a secret here.

# Backend API base URL. Defaults to http://localhost:4000 when unset (see src/api/client.ts).
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# ── CARTO basemaps (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The map widget defaults to OpenStreetMap, which needs no key.
# The CartoDB Voyager / Dark Matter options DO: basemaps.cartocdn.com now stamps
# "API KEY REQUIRED" over unauthenticated tiles. A key is free within CARTO's
# fair-use limit — request one at https://carto.com/basemaps/apikey (no CARTO
# account needed). Leave unset and the map config panel labels those two options
# "(API key required)".
# Heads-up: CARTO's raster PNG basemaps are being retired in favour of vector, so
# treat this as a stopgap rather than a long-term basemap.
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Query-param name the key is sent under. Defaults to api_key. Override if CARTO
# issues you a key that must be passed as ?key=… instead.
# VITE_CARTO_API_KEY_PARAM=api_key
